[Unit]
Description=Postmark settlement sweep, twice daily — 06:00/18:00 UTC on the dot, the law's own marks (world LOGOS/classes.md § crossing ②, amended 2026-09-17 by postmark-world#96); the Worldkeeper's heartbeat moved to :20 so his blessing still certifies a finished receipt

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 06:00:00 UTC
OnCalendar=*-*-* 18:00:00 UTC
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
